# Cloud Functions have no GPU. onnxruntime-node (via @imgly/background-removal-node)
# otherwise tries to download its CUDA binaries during the Cloud Build `npm ci`,
# and that GitHub release asset now answers 404 — failing EVERY functions deploy
# (19 Nov 2026). The package's own documented switch skips only the CUDA part;
# the CPU runtime is unchanged.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
